<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Splotty Support" />
    <title>Splotty Support</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --ink: #1e1b18;
        --muted: #625c56;
        --surface: #fffaf4;
        --accent: #a74f35;
        --rule: #ded5cd;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--ink);
        font: 18px/1.6 ui-rounded, "Avenir Next", Avenir, system-ui, sans-serif;
      }
      main { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
      header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      h1, h2 { line-height: 1.2; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 7vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 .5rem; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 2.25rem 0 .5rem; }
      p, li { max-width: 44rem; }
      .meta { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; }
      a { color: var(--accent); text-underline-offset: .16em; }
      strong { font-weight: 700; }
      ul { padding-left: 1.3rem; }
      li + li { margin-top: .6rem; }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root { color-scheme: dark; --ink: #f8eee5; --muted: #c9beb5; --surface: #1d1916; --accent: #ffaf91; --rule: #4e443d; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <h1>Splotty Support</h1>
        <p class="meta">Effective August 4, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <p>Need help with Splotty? Email <a href="mailto:kingstonduprojects@gmail.com">kingstonduprojects@gmail.com</a> and expect a response within 48&ndash;72 business hours.</p>

      <h2>Getting an invite</h2>
      <p>Splotty is invite-only. Ask an existing friend on Splotty to send you an invite from their app, or accept a friend request from someone already using it.</p>

      <h2>Sharing a Moment</h2>
      <p>Tap the camera button, capture or choose a single photo, add an optional caption, choose who can see it, and publish. Your friends can react with a Heart or Superheart.</p>

      <h2>Notifications</h2>
      <p>Turn Splotty notifications on or off any time in the app under Settings, or in iOS Settings &rsaquo; Notifications &rsaquo; Splotty.</p>

      <h2>Blocking and reporting</h2>
      <p>To block someone, open their profile and choose Block. To report a Moment or account, use the Report option where it appears &mdash; our team reviews every report.</p>

      <h2>Deleting your account</h2>
      <p>Open My Profile &rsaquo; Settings &rsaquo; Account, then choose Delete Account. This removes your content; see the <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Notice</a> for how long backups take to age out.</p>

      <h2>Something not working?</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:kingstonduprojects@gmail.com">kingstonduprojects@gmail.com</a> with a description of the issue and, if you can, a screenshot. Include your device model and iOS version if it's a crash or display problem.</p>

      <footer>
        <p>For how Splotty handles your data, see the <a href="privacy-policy.html">Splotty Privacy Notice</a>.</p>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
